# Supergroup finder

Group a large help library by broad purpose, such as using, configuring or maintaining the system, and define each purpose in a sentence. People scan purposes faster than file types. A document may belong to more than one purpose, so do not force a single home. Scope, result count, empty states, focus and the no-JavaScript fallback follow the [shared finder behaviour](../finder.html#finder-shared-contract).

## When to use it

Use it for a larger help library where broad purposes, such as using, configuring and maintaining the system, are easier to scan than technical file types.

## Home Assistant boundary

Do not silently turn entities into documents or replace Home Assistant’s area and domain grouping. Avoid a catch-all group whose contents cannot be predicted from its name.

